reply:
Here's a vocabulary flashcard study surface: a deck of ten flip cards on the left, and a review-progress panel on the right.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-learning.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 2,
          "gap": "2rem",
          "align": "top",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "page_header",
                  "title": "Vocabulary Builder",
                  "subtitle": "Tap or click a card to flip it and reveal the definition.",
                  "icon": "📚",
                  "tag": "10 cards",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5"
                },
                {
                  "type": "flashcard_deck",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "label_front": "WORD",
                  "label_back": "DEFINITION",
                  "cards": [
                    {"front": "Ephemeral", "back": "Lasting for a very short time. — \"The ephemeral beauty of cherry blossoms.\""},
                    {"front": "Ubiquitous", "back": "Present, appearing, or found everywhere. — \"Smartphones have become ubiquitous.\""},
                    {"front": "Candid", "back": "Truthful and straightforward; frank. — \"She gave a candid account of her mistakes.\""},
                    {"front": "Meticulous", "back": "Showing great attention to detail; very careful and precise."},
                    {"front": "Resilient", "back": "Able to recover quickly from difficulties; tough."},
                    {"front": "Pragmatic", "back": "Dealing with things sensibly and realistically, based on practical considerations."},
                    {"front": "Ambiguous", "back": "Open to more than one interpretation; not clearly defined."},
                    {"front": "Benevolent", "back": "Well-meaning and kindly; disposed to do good."},
                    {"front": "Eloquent", "back": "Fluent or persuasive in speaking or writing."},
                    {"front": "Tenacious", "back": "Holding firmly to something; persistent and determined."}
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "progress_ring",
                  "value": "0",
                  "size": "140",
                  "stroke_width": "10",
                  "color": "#4f46e5",
                  "label": "Cards reviewed",
                  "show_value": "true",
                  "unit": "%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "progress_bar",
                  "value": 0,
                  "label": "Review progress",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "show_percent": "true",
                  "caption": "0 of 10 cards reviewed"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text_callout",
                  "variant": "info",
                  "title": "Tip",
                  "description": "Say each definition aloud before flipping. Recalling it first strengthens memory far more than simply reading the answer."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The progress ring and bar start at 0 of 10. You can update their `value` (10% per card) as cards are reviewed.
